Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: bcm283x: Add cells encoding format to firmware bus
Date:   Thu, 26 Mar 2020 14:44:13 +0100
Message-Id: <20200326134413.12298-1-nsaenzjulienne@suse.de>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.25.1
